OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABrother will be 'angel on
OL,4,Ashoulder' for ultra walk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man taking on a 100km (62.1-mile)
OL,7,Fchallenge through the South Downs in
OL,8,Fmemory of his younger brother says he
OL,9,Fwill be the "little angel on my
OL,10,Fshoulder" throughout the trek.
OL,12,FSam Herschell, from Camberley in
OL,13,FSurrey, will walk a winding route from
OL,14,FEastbourne to Arundel, in honour of
OL,15,FTom, who died in 2002 aged 16.
OL,17,FAt two years old, Tom was diagnosed
OL,18,Fwith Duchenne Muscular Dystrophy, a
OL,19,Fmuscle wasting condition. Sam is taking
OL,20,Fpart in the South Coast Ultra Challenge
OL,21,Fto raise funds for Muscular Dystrophy
OL,22,FUK.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
