OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABrother will be 'angel on
OL,4,Ashoulder' for ultra walk
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam, 46, said: "Tom was never down,
OL,7,Fnever cried, never moaned and was
OL,8,Falways happy and smiling despite
OL,9,Feverything... I hope he'd be proud of
OL,10,Fme. He'll be my little angel on my
OL,11,Fshoulder."
